Greetings,
        Currently I am compiling a MUD compendium for the WWW. Amongst other
mud-related items would like a mudlist with info about each mud in it.
Wondering if you would like eastern pig to be on that list and if so could I
get some basic info about it to put on the list. If you want to be on it
just fill in the following and send it back...thanx :).

The following info is what i am after:

MUD NAME:

MUD EMAIL ADDRESS:

ADDRESS:

THEME:

ADMIN(s):

MUDLIB:

DRIVER:

REAL LIFE LOCATION:

WEB PAGE (if applicable):

OTHER COMMENTS (optional):	

CONTACT  EMAIL ADDRESS(wont appear on the review list):

While most of the above is pretty self explanitory thought
I would throw in a few details about each area to be on
the safe side.

*NAME - While I already know the name of the MUD, thought
I should ask you to add it in since it gives you the 
opportunity add in the name of the mud exactly how you 
would like it to appear in the list. Exact wording, 
correct cases etc.

*ADDRESS - The address of the MUD. This can be the IP name 
or number (so long as its valid)..your choice. You should 
know in the MUD index listing though it lists the MUD name 
and  with the IP number after it if it influences your 
decision one way or another on what you would like to put
in here.

*MUD EMAIL ADDRESS - An address people can contact if they
have queries etc. about the MUD. This might be an address 
specifically set up for the MUD, just an admins address 
for contact, etc.

*THEME - Theme is pretty self-explanitory...Science Fiction,
Fantasy, Star Trek,  etc. Dont feel bound by standard 
categories if they dont really fit. And if there is no theme
in particular let me know that too. 

*ADMINS - Any Admins/Gods/whatevers (with email addresses 
preferred but optional). If email addresses provided let me 
know if you would prefer they stay off the list and
I'll keep them confidential.

*MUDLIB and DRIVER - Include name AND version if possible of each

*REAL LIFE LOCATION: Town/City, State/Province and Country 
at least if possible. More detail if you like

*WEB PAGE - If the MUD has a web page would like to make a link
to it from the list, as well as add it to my list of MUD web 
pages.

*OTHER COMMENTS (optional) - This gives you a bit of license 
to show off special features, or add other important notes about 
the status of the MUD or other sundry details. All I ask is that
you just keep it concise and  to the point. Probably no more 
than a few lines at most. Basically this is a place for any 
other information you deem important enough to be on the review 
list that  doesn't fit into the above categories.

*CONTACT ADDRESS - Basically this is an email address I can contact
you on if necessary, and will not be displayed on the review list. 
(Unless it appears in one of the previous categories already as well). 
It's optional, but would be useful. I like to err on the side of 
>caution *grin*.

I'm always open to any other suggestions about what other info you 
think should be added to the list. If you think of anything let me 
know and add the appropriate information in with your reply.

